  "title": "Sausage and Cream Cheese Pinwheels",
  "description": "These sausage pinwheels will fly off the platter at your next party. Made with crescent roll dough, sausage, and cream cheese, they're a tasty treat!",
  "authors": [
    "brandi03"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-02T03:00:20-04:00",
